    "narrative": "The Austin Waves look to capitalize on favorable matchups today, anchored by **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** (74.61) and **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (73.66), who stand as our top plays. **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** benefits from a generous matchup against Noah Cameron, where a solid platoon advantage and a premium #2 slot boost his efficiency significantly. Meanwhile, **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** is primed for a productive outing against Hayden Wesneski; the combination of a favorable park factor and a +13% SP skill bump elevates him into the elite tier of our daily options. **Heliot Ramos** also deserves recognition as a strong start (63.20), as the matchup against Wesneski provides enough lift to mitigate his standard projection floor.\n\nWe remain cautious regarding high-end arms, specifically in the cases of **Luis Robert Jr.** (40.13) and **Kyle Tucker** (50.74). Both are facing elite SP_xERA threats in Jacob Misiorowski and Chris Sale, respectively, which heavily suppressed their scoring output. **Nasim Nunez** (57.24) sits right on the cusp of our \"Strong\" tier; while we prioritize his stolen base potential, his position in the #8 hole limits his run-scoring ceiling, keeping him in the marginal category. Our most difficult decision was managing the remaining depth, as players like **Sam Antonacci**, **Miguel Vargas**, and **Josh Jung** were considered, but ultimately the current configuration maximizes our upside in the scarcest category: speed. We are monitoring the status of **Curtis Mead**, **Liam Hicks**, **Wade Meckler**, **Luis Lara**, and **Tommy White** closely, but with **Jackson Merrill** sidelined due to a schedule gap and the ongoing IR stints of **Andy Pages**, **Jordan Westburg**, and **Jacob Wilson**, our options for rotation are currently restricted.\n\nFinal lineup integrity is contingent on official confirmations, as the \"Lineup Pending\" status for hitters like **Drake Baldwin** (51.19) and **Coby Mayo** (48.49) introduces volatility. Should these players shift lower in the batting order, their efficiency scores will likely see downward adjustments, particularly for **Drake Baldwin**, whose base projection is already tethered to his assumed leadoff role. We will monitor weather reports and late-scratches throughout the afternoon to ensure no further disruptions to our target scoring tiers.",
